63	     * known country-code prefix of {@code digits}.
64	     *
65	     * @param digits the E.164 body (country code plus national number, no {@code '+'}).
66	     * @return {@code false} only when {@code digits} starts with a country code that has a known
67	     *         national-number length and the national part does not match it; {@code true} for
68	     *         country codes without a known rule.
69	     */
