}
```

### Sequence-number source — `OwnerRepository.java`
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java`
```java
/** ... Used to build the per-city sequence embedded in an owner's {@code customerCode}. */
long countByCity(String city) throws DataAccessException;
```
This is implemented by the JDBC/JPA/Spring-Data owner repositories (`repository/jdbc/JdbcOwnerRepositoryImpl.java`, `repository/jpa/JpaOwnerRepositoryImpl.java`, `repository/springdatajpa/SpringDataOwnerRepository.java`).

