## 3. Create audit record logic

### `AuditOwnerCreated.java`
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AuditOwnerCreated.java`

Emits a single line to a dedicated SLF4J logger named `AUDIT`, after `SaveOwner` (so `id` exists):
